 7662+7E0E              ;may be called at any time from any place
 7663+7E0E              ;if "error_handler" called, it jumps to the highest level, if "display_error" is called, it returns,
 7664+7E0E              ;to from where it has been called
 7665+7E0E              ;3 types:
 7666+7E0E              ;display_error=		only displays error number from C input an returns with carry
